For SCALED_CLEAN_SEMALL.csv, SCALED_CLEAN_SEMGEN.csv, SCALED_CLEAN_SEMSPEC.csv:
Column
fips - county code
pop_density	- human population density
prop_hosts	- proportion of host trees out of nonhost trees in a county
treediversity_specrich_total	- total tree species richness in a county
MEAN_MAT - mean annual temperature
MEAN_MAP	- mean annual precipitation
height_difference_NHminH - difference in height between nonhost and host trees
diameter_difference_NHminH	- difference in diameter between nonhost and host trees
diameter_cv_t_difference_NHminH	- difference in variance in diameter between nonhost and host trees
height_cv_t_difference_NHminH	- difference in variance in height between nonhost and host trees
Total_pests	- total invasive insect pest richness for that county
lat	- latitude
US_L3NAME	- FIA level III ecoregion
broad_group	- forest type
s_prop_hosts - scale proportion of host trees out of nonhost trees in a county
s_diameter_cv_diff	- scaled difference in variance in diameter between nonhost and host trees
s_height_cv_diff - scaled difference in variance in height between nonhost and host trees
s_height_mean_diff	- scaled difference in height between nonhost and host trees
s_diameter_mean_diff - scaled difference in diameter between nonhost and host trees
s_pop_density	- scaled human population density
s_MEAN_MAP	- scaled mean annual precipitation
s_MEAN_MAT- scaled mean annual temperature
s_tree_div	- total tree species richness in a county
temp_bin - temperature bin
